  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for gimp",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for gimp fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in gimp:\n\n- CVE-2026-106061: plug-ins: Bound allocation for XMC import (bsc#1284473)\n- CVE-2026-106062: plug-ins/file-dds: fix out of bounds write (bsc#1284474)\n- CVE-2026-106063: plug-ins: Add bounds checks for DICOM export (bsc#1284475)\n- CVE-2026-82324: plug-ins: Add more checks for IFF import (bsc#1277594)\n- CVE-2026-82328: plug-ins: Use BPP for ICO palette allocation (bsc#1277618)\n- CVE-2026-82343: plug-ins: fix heap out of bounds in PSD loader (bsc#1277622)\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
